// Uses proj_no_labels from test 03. Edge traversal without type filter uses
// the from_to_edge B+Tree (Record<3>), which is one of the 5 "required"
// indexes - always built regardless of includeLabelIndexes. This confirms
// that GNN sampling (which traverses edges without filtering by type)
// remains fully functional on label-free projections.
USE proj_no_labels
MATCH (n)-[e]->(m)
RETURN count(*) AS total_edges
